program	export_suspending_error.saw
triple	arm64-apple-darwin
twin	same
expect	error
build	refused	cannot suspend in an `@export` function: `@export func worker` calls sleep (`worker` suspends at line 8)
meets_expect	yes
log	"error: cannot suspend in an `@export` function: `@export func worker` calls sleep (`worker` suspends at line 8)"
log	"  --> examples/export_suspending_error.saw:7:1"
log	"    |"
log	" 7 | func worker() {"
log	"    | ^"
log	"   hint: a `sync` context must be transitively suspension-free: remove the suspending call or hoist it out of the sync region"
log	""
log	"1 error(s) generated"
